"$$\n"
"(2t+1)\\theta = (2t+1) \\sin^{-1}{\\sqrt{\\frac{|\\mathcal{A}_1|}{N}}}\\approx (2t+1) \\sqrt{\\frac{|\\mathcal{A}_1|}{N}} \\approx \\pi/2\\\\\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"t \\approx \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\sqrt{\\frac{N}{|\\mathcal{A}_1|}}-\\frac{1}{2}\n"
"$$\n"
